Algorithms in this library are Go ports of PyThaiNLP's:
  - pythainlp/tokenize/newmm.py   (maximal-matching word tokenizer)
  - pythainlp/tokenize/tcc_p.py   (Thai Character Cluster segmentation)
  - pythainlp/util/trie.py        (dictionary trie)
  - pythainlp/util/normalize.py   (text normalization)
  - pythainlp/soundex/metasound.py (MetaSound phonetic key)
  - pythainlp/tokenize/crfcut.py  (CRF sentence segmentation)

Changes from the original: the algorithms were reimplemented in Go; the TCC
look-ahead regexes were hand-coded as zero-allocation matchers (a regexp2-based
oracle in the test suite verifies exact equivalence); the dictionary is stored
as a flat, memory-mappable trie for near-instant loading; the crfcut CRF
inference (feature extraction + Viterbi) was reimplemented in pure Go over the
exported model weights.
